# promise: #502
# Arc's dark ⌘T bar shows the page through it: (26,26,26) over a black page, ≈ 47 over a white one. Cra's
# tint over the bar's hudWindow material is CommandBarTones.panel: neutral 26 grey at 0.85 in dark (before
# #502, (46,45,45) at 0.97 kept the bar at 45–50 over anything); the light bar keeps white at 0.94.
# CommandBarPanelTests holds the composite; this checks the bar draws that tint.
budget rss=600 stalls50=10
seed settings.json {"hasSeenImportPrompt": true, "toolbarDefaultMigrated": true, "showToolbar": false}
cra://debug?windowSize=1280x800
cra://open?url=${PAGE}?n=see-through
expect-log loaded 127\.0\.0\.1 \(HTTP 200\)
cra://debug?systemAppearance=dark
wait 1
cra://commandbar?query=
wait 1
cra://debug?commandBarScope=state
wait 1
expect-log command bar scope state: none, fill default, panel #1A1A1A at 0\.85
cra://dismiss
wait 1
cra://debug?systemAppearance=light
wait 1
cra://commandbar?query=
wait 1
cra://debug?commandBarScope=state
wait 1
expect-log command bar scope state: none, fill default, panel #FFFFFF at 0\.94
cra://dismiss
wait 1
cra://debug?systemAppearance=system
